    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it wasn't just a little mistake. it was a massive oversight. i can see the consequences every single day. you talk about growing and learning, but how do you grow when you've fundamentally broken the trust and safety of another human being? some things aren't just \"mistakes\" you move past. they're permanent. i feel like the world would literally be better, cleaner, if i just wasn't in it anymore. it feels more like a debt than a mistake.",
